    "notes": [
      "VDD_HP_0/2/3 (1.1 V) come from an external step-down converter that EN_DCDC switches on and whose feedback FB_DCDC trims: give the block its output (vddHp).",
      "VDD_PSRAM_0/1 run from VDDO_PSRAM (the in-package PSRAM's 1.9 V LDO); VDD_MIPI_DPHY from VDDO_3 set to 2.5 V by the firmware.",
      "Route DSI and CSI lanes as 100 ohm differential pairs, the clock lane matched to its data lanes; keep the 40 MHz crystal next to XTAL_P/N."
    ],
    "page": "ESP32-P4 Hardware Design Guidelines, 2 Schematic Checklist (power, crystal, flash, chip enable); datasheet 2.6 Power Supply"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Chip revision v1.x parts (ESP32-P4NRW32) are end of life; their successors (ESP32-P4NRW32X, revision v3.x) need images built for v3.",
    "GPIO35 high at reset boots from flash (low: download mode); GPIO37/38 are the ROM console UART0."
  ],
